or anchor is broken; **every managed file and block still hashes to the value
committed in `.rn-forge/kiln/state.json`**; {% if not node_lib %}pyright is clean; {% endif %}the tests pass;
and the docs site builds `--strict`.

{% else %}`task validate` proves: {% if not node_lib %}ruff is clean and formatted{% if workspace %} in every package{% endif %}; {% endif %}the archetype's
